Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:46.49,akiba-phone,,0,0,0,,{\fs37.5\frz354.3\frx12\fry0\pos(981.6,384)}抱歉齁一直要你代替哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:46.49,akiba-phone,,0,0,0,,{\fs37.5\frz354.3\frx12\fry0\pos(866.4,484.8)}萬世姐、我到了今天巡邏的地方了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:46.49,akiba-phone,,0,0,0,,{\fs37.5\frz354.3\frx12\fry0\pos(979.2,612)}我知道了。我帶著保很快就去！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:46.49,akiba-phone,,0,0,0,,{\fs37.5\frz354.3\frx12\fry0\pos(702.515,670.714)}等著你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:46.49,akiba-phone,,0,0,0,,{\fs37.5\frz354.3\frx12\fry0\pos(866.4,825.6)}做點自己會開心的事情就行了哦
